        "original_id": "77433b0f-d4c9-50ab-b9da-4c8a2ff6fe04",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Flyboys, Milk, Pineapple Express, Rise of the Planet of the Apes, Spring Breakers, Oz the Great and Powerful, This Is the End, The Disaster Artist, Spider-Man trilogy, The Little Prince, Sausage Party\n- People: James Franco, Martin Henderson, Jean Reno, Jennifer Decker, David Ellison, Abdul Salis, Philip Winchester, Tyler Labine, Sam Raimi\n- Concepts: World War I\n- Roles: actor, director, screenwriter, producer\n\nFacts:\n- James Edward Franco was born on April 19, 1978, and he is an American actor, director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- Flyboys is a 2006 war drama film set during World War I.\n- Flyboys stars James Franco, Martin Henderson, Jean Reno, Jennifer Decker, David Ellison, Abdul Salis, Philip Winchester, and Tyler Labine.\n- James Franco is known for roles in the live-action films Milk and Pineapple Express, both released in 2008.\n- James Franco is known for roles in Sam Raimi's Spider-Man trilogy.\n- James Franco is known for roles in the live-action films Rise of the Planet of the Apes in 2011 and Spring Breakers in 2012.\n- James Franco is known for roles in the live-action films Oz the Great and Powerful and This Is the End, both released in 2013.\n- James Franco voiced characters in the animated films The Little Prince in 2015 and Sausage Party in 2016.\n- James Franco is known for a role in The Disaster Artist, released in 2017.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
